<title>HONG KONG: Techtronic 1996 net rises 81.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Techtronic 1996 net rises 81.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   21.07    vs  11.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0	vs  3.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  10.0 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    105.72   vs  58.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,906.08 vs  1,375.76</p>
<p>    Company name		 Techtronic Industries Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 14-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Techtronic Industries is a maker of power tools and electrical appliances.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 8.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 3.5 cents) vs 6.3 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
